      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Officially we don't support using controllers as trackers although that did work in the past. At the moment only devices that report its TrackingType as \"GenericTracker\" to SteamVR are supported to work as a tracker.\nIt's possible to flash Vive controllers to behave as a GenericTracker if you want this to work again right now, but if you try this it's at your own risk to your hardware.\nAlso, it's possible that controllers-as-trackers may once again function at some point in the future, but both previously and currently it isn't something that we officially support.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
