      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: Thank you for replying Kung! I really hope this can be fixed soon, i know quite a few of people who aren't fortunate enough to afford proper trackers as well, but we love the game enough to acquire different methods to play the game to the fullest. I'm looking forward to an update and fix to this <3",
