      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: The claim that they weren't \"officially supported\" seems a bit misleading - without any modifications to the client, the client would treat controllers as trackers. The official build of the game supported that, therefore saying it's not \"officially supported\" is incorrect - 'not intentionally' supported, perhaps, but it definitely was SUPPORTED in the OFFICIAL build.\nA lot of people got VRC+ on the basis that the game would continue to work with the equipment that it worked with out of the box. It now doesn't. If your copy of windows all of a sudden didn't support Office apps just because your keyboard has the US layout instead of the GB one you would understandably ask that there's a fix for the thing you've paid for or some way to revert back\nWithout wishing to overstate it, this does come under deceptive buisiness practices in the EU, as users were not warned or consulted before functionality was knowingly removed from them without recourse or reimbursement.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
