      "value": "@{6161a61a2c0de966b4e43486|full_name}: I just don't understand why they worked in the beta, and now they suddenly don't work. \nAlso, seeing that they did work (even though it was unintentional), shows that its probably not hard to keep it the way it was.\nThe game worked just fine with people using hybrid, and now it suddenly doesn't.\nEdit: Now we are forced to mess with the firmware of the controllers (which can be dangerous) if we want to use them as trackers.",
